 "description": "STBL is a next generation stablecoin protocol enabling Stablecoin 2.0, separating principal and yield on-chain to power transparent, RWA-backed stablecoins. It issues USST (stable principal) and YLD (tokenized yield), with $STBL holders governing and sharing protocol value via staking and buybacks. Founded by Reeve Collins (Tether) and Dr. Avtar Sehra (Kaio), STBL combines proven stablecoin experience with advanced financial engineering for a secure, scalable system.",
